    "enUS": {
      "description": "He must be put out of his misery, soldier! He knows not what he does. He has become a mindless servant of the dreaded Banshee Queen.\n\nVenture forth, across the Field of Strife, to the depths of Frostwolf territory. Find my brother and destroy him. His torment must come to an end.",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Commander Louis Philips slain",
          "type": "monster"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Travel into Frostwolf territory and slay Commander Louis Philips. Return to Commander Karl Philips when the task is complete.\n",
      "title": "Brotherly Love",
